Qg%3D","duration":6457,"title":"陆总，您的甜妻已到达深城","video_desc":"1979年，知青苏婉婷因被举报未婚先孕失去返城资格，独自抚养儿子苏小乐。六年后，她带着儿子到深城打拼，意外进入陆氏集团工作，与总裁陆尹锡重逢。而苏婉婷与陆尹锡在职场相处过程中逐渐相爱。面对姜梦瑶的陷害和陆父的阻挠，两人最终携手化解危机，迎来双胞胎诞生，实现事业与家庭的双重圆满。","series_id":"7552861491670551577","episode":true,"vertical":true,"content_type":1,"recommend_info":"{\"channel_id\":\"94349560332\",\"request_id\":\"20261106233118D72BB875DA1C988BF422\",\"rank\":\"9\",\"queue_names\":\"shortplay\",\"final_queue_name\":\"heji\",\"gid\":\"7552861491670551577\",\"plan_id\":\"1\",\"is_show_ad_flag\":\"0\",\"series_pred_score\":\"{\\\"stream_ctr\\\":0.045185916125774384,\\\"staytime_stream\\\":1.0517688989639282,\\\"normalized_duration\\\":0.7607598900794983,\\\"like\\\":0.05184546485543251,\\\"absolute_staytime\\\":0.10705902427434921,\\\"finish\\\":0.001648483332246542,\\\"collect\\\":0.03461884334683418}\"}","recommend_group_id":"7552861491670551577","play_cnt":9244,"book_exist":false,"copyright":"西瓜创想短剧","sub_title":"爱情·年代爱情","score":"8.3","use_video_model":true,"episode_cnt":62,"video_platform":3,"disable_play":false,"category_schema":"[{\"category_id\":5000,\"name\":\"爱情\",\"schema\":\"dragon8662://categorySearch?categoryId=5000&categoryName=爱情&genreType=130&gender=0&source=detail\"},{\"category_id\":5131,\"name\":\"年代爱情\",\"schema\":\"dragon8662://categorySearch?categoryId=5131&categoryName=年代爱情&genreType=130&gender=0&source=detail\"},{\"category_id\":5104,\"name\":\"日久生情\",\"schema\":\"dragon8662://categorySearch?categoryId=5104&categoryName=日久生情&genreType=130&gender=0&source=detail\"},{\"category_id\":5175,\"name\":\"打脸反派\",\"schema\":\"dragon8662://categorySearch?categoryId=5175&categoryName=打脸反派&genreType=130&gender=0&source=detail\"},{\"category_id\":5206,\"name\":\"总裁\",\"schema\":\"dragon8662://categorySearch?categoryId=5206&categoryName=总裁&genreType=130&gender=0&source=detail\"},{\"category_id\":5301,\"name\":\"职场\",\"schema\":\"dragon8662://categorySearch?categoryId=5301&categoryName=职场&genreType=130&gender=0&source=detail\"